1
00:00:32,571 --> 00:00:34,204
What should I do?

2
00:00:49,582 --> 00:00:51,041
Hello.

3
00:00:51,041 --> 00:00:53,321
- Do you have the break lever?
- I don't have the lever yet.

4
00:00:53,321 --> 00:00:56,819
- It's going to take a week to get it.
- Okay. Then fix it when you get that.

5
00:00:56,819 --> 00:00:58,534
Have it checked please.

6
00:00:58,569 --> 00:01:02,264
- Did you buy another motorcycle again?
- No. That's not mine. It's hers.

7
00:01:03,847 --> 00:01:06,960
You must be happy that your girlfriend
has the same hobby as yours.

8
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:35,136
Your skin looks older under the sunshine.

9
00:01:35,136 --> 00:01:37,265
Your ugly face doesn't change at all.

10
00:01:37,265 --> 00:01:39,225
I read a newspaper a few days ago.

11
00:01:39,225 --> 00:01:43,439
There was a story about a woman who
killed a man because he called her ugly.

12
00:01:43,439 --> 00:01:46,454
And the man was about 50 years old.

13
00:01:46,641 --> 00:01:49,595
- So are you going to kill me?
- No.

14
00:01:49,595 --> 00:01:54,228
Somebody is going to kill you even if it's
not me if you treat a woman like this.

15
00:01:54,228 --> 00:01:56,513
I only do that to you.
I don't talk to women like this.

16
00:01:56,513 --> 00:02:01,107
- I look so easy to you, don't I?
- I don't know. I feel so comfortable with you.

17
00:02:01,107 --> 00:02:03,479
I'm not a rude man actually.

18
00:02:03,479 --> 00:02:06,636
What are you two doing?
You're interrupting the conduct of business.

19
00:02:06,636 --> 00:02:08,754
I was going to go inside.
Where are you going?

20
00:02:08,754 --> 00:02:11,484
I'm trying to build one more
restaurant but there's so much to do.

21
00:02:11,484 --> 00:02:14,737
- Besides, I got to do the engagement.
- Doing that is useless.

22
00:02:14,737 --> 00:02:17,957
It's hard to find useful things
while preparing the wedding.

23
00:02:17,957 --> 00:02:21,068
Bye guys.
Tell him to buy delicious food.

24
00:02:23,769 --> 00:02:26,780
He never gives me anything for free.
I always have to pay him.

25
00:02:27,266 --> 00:02:29,409
Is being a handsome guy everything?

26
00:02:29,730 --> 00:02:33,464
He's not handsome. He looks like a player.

27
00:02:33,464 --> 00:02:36,289
You look better than him.
There's no woman like Dong Bi.

28
00:02:36,290 --> 00:02:38,123
How could she marry another man?

29
00:02:48,654 --> 00:02:51,590
- I came to report a missing person.
- Are you a family member?

30
00:02:51,590 --> 00:02:53,134
No, I'm her friend.

31
00:02:53,134 --> 00:02:55,735
- How long has it been?
- It has been about a week.

32
00:02:55,735 --> 00:02:57,239
Did her family get a call from her or something?

33
00:02:57,239 --> 00:03:01,539
I don't know her family's phone number.
Can I search for it? She's from Busan.

34
00:03:01,539 --> 00:03:03,755
You're her friend but you don't know their phone number?

35
00:03:03,755 --> 00:03:05,256
Then she must've went to her house.

36
00:03:05,256 --> 00:03:10,236
Can you use a tracking device to find where she is?

37
00:03:10,236 --> 00:03:11,752
That way I can feel better.

38
00:03:11,752 --> 00:03:14,428
We can only use that device
under certain conditions.

39
00:03:14,428 --> 00:03:16,125
You should just call 911.

40
00:03:16,125 --> 00:03:20,557
You need to be a family member, or bring
some sort of evidence that she was kidnapped.

41
00:03:20,557 --> 00:03:23,322
Or you should know her identification
number and her address.

42
00:03:23,322 --> 00:03:25,685
But you don't meet any of these conditions.

43
00:03:30,957 --> 00:03:33,419
You're the only friend to me.

44
00:03:33,419 --> 00:03:38,250
You're the only friend to me too.
Without you, I'd be a woman without a friend.

45
00:03:38,250 --> 00:03:42,377
- Let's toast for our bright year of 2008!
- Cheers!

46
00:03:55,782 --> 00:03:58,597
If you're on a trip, at least text
me that you're fine.

47
00:03:58,597 --> 00:04:00,218
Otherwise, we're not friends anymore.

48
00:04:03,465 --> 00:04:07,194
There's nobody I can talk to except for you.

49
00:04:20,663 --> 00:04:22,252
Hae Yoon.

50
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:32,228
He's ignoring my calls again.
This reminds me of the old times.

51
00:04:43,747 --> 00:04:45,926
I told you I'm sorry for slapping you.

52
00:04:45,926 --> 00:04:49,843
You keep ignoring my calls and texts.
You did that when you broke up with me.

53
00:04:50,509 --> 00:04:53,151
What people do when they break up with their
lover is who they really are! It's so true.

54
00:04:53,151 --> 00:04:55,497
You're the same son of a bitch from the old times.

55
00:04:59,005 --> 00:05:01,197
Sang Jin.

56
00:05:02,833 --> 00:05:04,177
Hello.

57
00:05:04,177 --> 00:05:08,033
You do know how to make me feel sorry.

58
00:05:08,279 --> 00:05:10,340
I haven't been able to contact Dong Bi for days.

59
00:05:10,340 --> 00:05:13,283
I went to the police to report a
disappearance but they didn't listen to me.

60
00:05:13,283 --> 00:05:13,815
So?

61
00:05:13,815 --> 00:05:17,055
Find her please. You're a lawyer.
There must be some policemen you know.

62
00:05:17,055 --> 00:05:19,064
I'm going to meet my
friends to drink tonight.

63
00:05:19,064 --> 00:05:22,811
So you can't? What's wrong with these people?
Why can't they take it seriously?

64
00:05:22,811 --> 00:05:25,007
I can't contact her!

65
00:05:25,007 --> 00:05:27,429
Then come to my office.
I'll finish it as soon as possible.

66
00:05:31,918 --> 00:05:35,642
Hi. Dr. Nam is doing the surgery now.
Please wait.

67
00:05:35,642 --> 00:05:39,016
- I'll wait at his office.
- Hey, hey.

68
00:05:49,510 --> 00:05:51,169
What are you doing?

69
00:05:51,339 --> 00:05:55,371
- Playing a game.
- I mean, why are you playing a game here?

70
00:05:55,371 --> 00:05:58,968
- Who are you?
- Aren't you a model?

71
00:06:00,693 --> 00:06:03,780
Have we met before?

72
00:06:03,780 --> 00:06:07,001
No. People told me that.

73
00:06:07,001 --> 00:06:10,219
This is our third time to see each other.

74
00:06:12,762 --> 00:06:20,077
Dr. Nam, he's asking me what I'm doing and
he's not telling me who he is before he asked.

75
00:06:20,077 --> 00:06:21,918
I need to talk to you for a moment.

76
00:06:31,527 --> 00:06:34,470
What's wrong with you?
I'm too stunned to get mad at you.

77
00:06:34,470 --> 00:06:38,029
I think you hate a woman who cries
and you hate a stupid woman even more.

78
00:06:38,029 --> 00:06:43,910
So I changed the plan. What is it that you
can give to me if I break up with you?

79
00:06:44,832 --> 00:06:48,065
Nothing. So this is how you
use your brain to look smart?

80
00:06:48,065 --> 00:06:50,956
Yeah. This is all that I can.

81
00:06:51,493 --> 00:06:58,099
So I was thinking that it's better to borrow
a smart brain before I get dumped by you.

82
00:06:58,506 --> 00:07:01,755
I'm going to sue you for committing illicit
sexual acts under false promises of marriage.

83
00:07:02,941 --> 00:07:05,645
- Why?
- Come here.

84
00:07:06,714 --> 00:07:09,436
You got scared because I told you
I'm going to sue you, didn't you?

85
00:07:11,128 --> 00:07:13,066
Let's just keep seeing each other.

86
00:07:13,066 --> 00:07:15,744
I won't feel threatened by
you because you're stupid.

87
00:07:16,189 --> 00:07:17,532
You didn't get scared?

88
00:07:17,532 --> 00:07:19,329
It has been a long time
since that crime is gone.

89
00:07:19,329 --> 00:07:21,774
- Is it gone?
- Just do what I tell you.

90
00:07:21,774 --> 00:07:24,332
If you do that, I won't leave you.

91
00:07:30,351 --> 00:07:32,776
I'm sorry for making you wait.
Let's go to a treatment room.

92
00:07:34,154 --> 00:07:37,103
- I'm just going to go home.
- Why?

93
00:07:37,103 --> 00:07:39,821
Who's that woman?

94
00:07:39,821 --> 00:07:41,566
Is this what I'm thinking?

95
00:07:42,582 --> 00:07:45,468
You can't say until you know it's 100% sure.

96
00:07:45,468 --> 00:07:48,488
You're cheating with her, aren't you?

97
00:07:50,844 --> 00:07:52,864
End it with her before others find out.

98
00:07:54,050 --> 00:07:56,031
You don't understand because you
haven't lived up to my age.

99
00:07:56,031 --> 00:07:58,896
Don't tell me you understand just
because you and I are men.

100
00:07:58,896 --> 00:08:03,337
Morals are what we're supposed
to follow to be good people!

101
00:08:48,598 --> 00:08:49,940
Hey, Sis.

102
00:08:49,940 --> 00:08:52,102
- Did you get the gifts?
- Yeah.

103
00:08:52,102 --> 00:08:55,359
Then why didn't you call me?
Am I supposed to call you first?

104
00:08:55,359 --> 00:08:58,205
- I was going to.
- Then buy me dinner.

105
00:08:58,205 --> 00:09:00,861
Then what about my husband's dinner?

106
00:09:00,861 --> 00:09:02,954
You have a maid.

107
00:09:02,954 --> 00:09:04,335
She will go home soon.

108
00:09:04,335 --> 00:09:06,583
What's your daughter-in-law going to do about the gift?

109
00:09:06,583 --> 00:09:08,792
We've decided not to do that kind of stuff.

110
00:09:08,792 --> 00:09:14,646
People waste so much money on that.
We don't want to be one of them.

111
00:09:14,646 --> 00:09:16,364
Then am I not going to get
any gift from you guys?

112
00:09:16,364 --> 00:09:18,810
But my daughter-in-law sent you the gifts.

113
00:09:18,810 --> 00:09:21,378
We're not getting anything from Hae Yoon.
How can she send you gifts?

114
00:09:21,378 --> 00:09:25,441
You're married a man who
had no ambitions but only love.

115
00:09:25,441 --> 00:09:28,281
And now your son and his wife
are doing the same thing.

116
00:09:29,092 --> 00:09:31,570
You can probably work that out this time.

117
00:09:31,570 --> 00:09:35,365
But it'd be hard to hang out with you
if it goes to the 3rd generation.

118
00:09:37,406 --> 00:09:39,383
Did your husband stop cheating on you?

119
00:09:41,127 --> 00:09:43,962
What we're looking for is different.

120
00:09:44,270 --> 00:09:46,694
There isn't anything about you that I envy.

121
00:09:46,694 --> 00:09:49,266
My husband and I still love each other so much.

122
00:09:50,005 --> 00:09:55,622
Have you felt this warmth and love in your life?

123
00:09:56,508 --> 00:10:00,611
You probably don't know because you're
doing the same thing our parents did.

124
00:10:00,611 --> 00:10:02,258
That's the downside.

125
00:10:02,258 --> 00:10:07,056
You know Hae Yoon's sister married a
married man and ruined the family, right?

126
00:10:07,056 --> 00:10:11,475
And Hae Yoon is someone from that kind of family.

127
00:10:22,854 --> 00:10:25,076
What I'm suffering for now is...

128
00:10:25,777 --> 00:10:28,799
the cost of what I had done wrong in my previous life.

129
00:10:45,577 --> 00:10:49,210
I'm on my way to see you. Please come.

130
00:11:14,855 --> 00:11:16,276
You came early.

131
00:11:16,276 --> 00:11:19,623
I can't hang out with people when
I know someone is waiting for me.

132
00:11:19,623 --> 00:11:22,080
- Did you drink a lot?
- A glass of beer.

133
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,855
So what happened to Dong Bi?

134
00:11:23,855 --> 00:11:28,143
Tell me about the last time you saw her
with every detail that you are certain of.

135
00:11:28,143 --> 00:11:32,059
I was sitting across from her at this restaurant.

136
00:11:32,059 --> 00:11:34,280
- And we talked.
- About what?

137
00:11:35,076 --> 00:11:39,088
- I can't tell you.
- Then I can't make the right judgment.

138
00:11:39,088 --> 00:11:41,785
There might be a clue in that conversation.

139
00:11:41,785 --> 00:11:44,838
She might have gotten mad at you because of
the conversation and ignored your calls.

140
00:11:44,838 --> 00:11:47,966
- That's not it. Leave that out.
- You want me to help you or not?

141
00:11:47,966 --> 00:11:52,197
Anyway, the news was on TV and she
was gazing at it for a while.

142
00:11:52,197 --> 00:11:54,177
What was the news about?

143
00:11:54,177 --> 00:11:56,899
I couldn't hear it well because I
was sitting back against the TV.

144
00:11:56,899 --> 00:11:59,342
Anyway, it was about somebody's death.

145
00:11:59,342 --> 00:12:03,774
What date was it? If we searched
what was in the news on that day,

146
00:12:03,774 --> 00:12:05,520
then we can find if it's
related with her disappearance.

147
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:06,950
What if it's not?

148
00:12:06,950 --> 00:12:10,845
Then you'll have to tell me
what you guys talked about.

149
00:12:10,845 --> 00:12:14,187
But you will soon. What's there to
be related with Dong Bi on the news?

150
00:12:18,268 --> 00:12:20,284
Jung Hoon.

151
00:12:21,786 --> 00:12:24,096
It's not a video chat. Get it.

152
00:12:27,469 --> 00:12:30,248
- Hello?
- How's your cold?

153
00:12:31,385 --> 00:12:33,798
I got better.

154
00:12:43,352 --> 00:12:46,998
- What was that?
- What do you mean? I didn't hear anything.

155
00:12:46,998 --> 00:12:50,076
- Where are you?
- I'm home.

156
00:12:50,076 --> 00:12:53,138
- Then come out. I'm in front of your house.
- What?

157
00:12:53,138 --> 00:12:55,687
The light in your room is turned off.
Are you with your mom?

158
00:12:56,164 --> 00:12:57,827
No.

159
00:12:58,752 --> 00:13:01,876
- Come out.
- Can we meet later?

160
00:13:01,885 --> 00:13:03,868
I bought porridge.
I'll go home after I give it to you.

161
00:13:03,868 --> 00:13:07,376
Please don't get mad.

162
00:13:07,376 --> 00:13:08,716
What is it?

163
00:13:08,716 --> 00:13:11,082
- I'm not home.
- Then where are you?

164
00:13:12,050 --> 00:13:14,660
- I'm at Dong Bi's house.
- Why? Is she back?

165
00:13:14,660 --> 00:13:17,359
No. I came to check if she's back.

166
00:13:17,359 --> 00:13:19,031
Wait there. I'll go now.

167
00:13:21,199 --> 00:13:24,349
- Shoot. I got to go.
- Let me give you a ride.

168
00:13:24,349 --> 00:13:26,994
- You drank a beer.
- But it was only one glass.

169
00:13:26,994 --> 00:13:30,303
- But still!
- Oh, my coat!

170
00:13:55,831 --> 00:13:58,662
Oh my God! Everything will be over!

171
00:14:00,226 --> 00:14:01,961
Let's give it a shot though.

172
00:14:09,691 --> 00:14:11,275
What are you doing here?

173
00:14:11,275 --> 00:14:13,944
- We see each other very often.
- What are you doing here?

174
00:14:13,944 --> 00:14:17,267
I came to see Dong Bi.
I'm helping her business now.

175
00:14:17,267 --> 00:14:19,610
But I haven't heard from her.
What about you?

176
00:14:19,610 --> 00:14:21,293
Me too.

177
00:14:21,293 --> 00:14:23,946
- Then let's go together.
- She's not here now.

178
00:14:24,932 --> 00:14:27,205
You knew she's not here.
Then why did you come here?

179
00:14:27,205 --> 00:14:29,255
Didn't you say you came to see her?

180
00:14:31,819 --> 00:14:33,998
Would you like to drink with me?

181
00:14:39,927 --> 00:14:41,753
Thank you.

182
00:14:42,110 --> 00:14:45,439
Please understand Hae Yoon.

183
00:14:46,957 --> 00:14:50,582
She has this habit of worrying about
things that are going to happen.

184
00:14:50,582 --> 00:14:53,859
That's why she's overreacting
and that causes a problem.

185
00:14:53,859 --> 00:14:55,900
I know that too.

186
00:14:55,900 --> 00:14:59,596
What happened last time was part
of my responsibility. I'm sorry.

187
00:15:00,367 --> 00:15:04,019
Are you saying sorry instead of her?
You're acting like you're already married to her.

188
00:15:04,019 --> 00:15:06,088
Only the wedding is left.

189
00:15:06,088 --> 00:15:11,618
Well, preparing for the wedding
is harder than it looks.

190
00:15:11,618 --> 00:15:14,403
Especially, in this country, saving
one's face is very important.

191
00:15:14,403 --> 00:15:16,762
Many couples break up because of that.

192
00:15:16,762 --> 00:15:18,303
That's not going to happen to us.

193
00:15:18,303 --> 00:15:21,255
There were many crises that we went
through while preparing for the wedding.

194
00:15:21,255 --> 00:15:24,132
- But we overcame them well.
- Really?

195
00:15:24,620 --> 00:15:26,903
I've done many divorce lawsuits.

196
00:15:26,903 --> 00:15:31,556
Couples who fought a lot during
that process came to get a divorce.

197
00:15:31,556 --> 00:15:34,355
So are you saying I'm going to
get a divorce or something?

198
00:15:34,355 --> 00:15:37,313
- I'm not cursing you or something.
- I think you are.

199
00:15:37,313 --> 00:15:41,438
If that's what you think, maybe it is.
People hear how they want to hear.

200
00:15:41,438 --> 00:15:43,566
Maybe you want me to
think it's a curse.

201
00:15:48,668 --> 00:15:50,298
Hang on.

202
00:15:50,298 --> 00:15:52,248
This is Jun Sang Jin.

203
00:15:55,196 --> 00:15:58,203
- How's your cold?
- It got better.

204
00:16:00,066 --> 00:16:01,947
What was that?

205
00:16:01,947 --> 00:16:04,593
I should get going now.

206
00:16:06,514 --> 00:16:11,803
- Your ring tone is very unique.
- I have a unique taste on that.

207
00:16:11,803 --> 00:16:13,427
- I see.
- Why?

208
00:16:13,427 --> 00:16:15,915
Because I think I heard it somewhere before.

209
00:16:15,915 --> 00:16:18,036
Then I'll see you later with Hae Yoon.

210
00:16:18,036 --> 00:16:20,728
I don't think you will.

211
00:16:20,728 --> 00:16:22,324
I'm not that cool.

212
00:16:22,324 --> 00:16:25,468
I see. Then let's meet up with Dong Bi.

213
00:16:40,673 --> 00:16:45,898
How can I not call you?
What's there to talk about with him anyway?

214
00:16:45,898 --> 00:16:50,894
You're so mean. Aren't you supposed to say
thank you? You only care about him.

215
00:16:50,894 --> 00:16:53,967
- Thank you.
- Sure, whatever.

216
00:16:53,967 --> 00:16:57,876
What was I doing there anyway?
Why am I doing this to you?

217
00:16:58,805 --> 00:17:00,359
I got to go.

218
00:17:04,411 --> 00:17:06,382
Do you know who I just met?

219
00:17:06,382 --> 00:17:08,889
- Who?
- Jun Sang Jin.

220
00:17:08,889 --> 00:17:13,216
He came to see Dong Bi. Aren't you surprised?
It's like you knew about it already.

221
00:17:13,216 --> 00:17:16,454
I'm usually calm and relaxed in any situation.

222
00:17:16,643 --> 00:17:18,883
- By the way...
- What?

223
00:17:18,883 --> 00:17:22,545
She would hate me if I ask why she lied to me, right?

224
00:17:22,545 --> 00:17:24,716
Never mind.
Oh, anyway.

225
00:17:24,716 --> 00:17:26,320
What is it?

226
00:17:26,320 --> 00:17:29,545
I'm sure I heard IU's song when
I was on the phone with you.

227
00:17:30,651 --> 00:17:34,061
- It's Sang Jin's ring tone.

228
00:17:34,061 --> 00:17:37,656
I know it's impossible for you
to be with him at that time.

229
00:17:37,656 --> 00:17:40,478
It was kind of creepy when
I heard his ring tone.

230
00:17:40,478 --> 00:17:41,943
Did a ghost do a prank on
his phone or something?

231
00:17:41,943 --> 00:17:44,193
If it's a ghost that did it,
it's a good sign.

232
00:17:44,193 --> 00:17:47,561
People say if singers see a ghost at their
studio, there song will be a big hit.

233
00:17:48,629 --> 00:17:52,238
Yeah. Then our wedding will be a big hit.

234
00:17:52,238 --> 00:17:56,082
- Oh, I should call your father.
- You don't forget about anything.

235
00:18:04,768 --> 00:18:08,427
- Hey, Son.
- Mr. Hae, it's Hae Yoon.

236
00:18:08,427 --> 00:18:10,445
Hello.

237
00:18:10,445 --> 00:18:15,398
Thank you for the wedding gifts.
I'm sorry
that I'm not a good daughter-in-law.

238
00:18:15,398 --> 00:18:16,382
It's okay.

239
00:18:16,382 --> 00:18:21,106
As much as you love me, I'll try not
to make you disappointed in me.

240
00:18:21,106 --> 00:18:25,799
You don't have to do that.
Let's just be comfortable with each other.

241
00:18:25,799 --> 00:18:28,941
- Okay, Mr. Hae.
- Alright.

242
00:18:30,711 --> 00:18:34,688
It's not easy to make someone become my family.

243
00:18:43,371 --> 00:18:45,456
It's good you didn't go to the hospital.

244
00:18:45,456 --> 00:18:46,943
Why?

245
00:18:46,943 --> 00:18:49,032
He wasn't kind.

246
00:18:49,032 --> 00:18:52,275
Was Do Hyun not kind to you?

247
00:18:59,124 --> 00:19:01,165
What are you doing?

248
00:19:01,165 --> 00:19:04,023
Do you remember when I asked you
out after I got my first salary?

249
00:19:05,873 --> 00:19:08,366
I think love is forever.

250
00:19:08,366 --> 00:19:10,860
It's a person that changes, not love.

251
00:19:13,688 --> 00:19:16,211
Love doesn't change.

252
00:19:17,054 --> 00:19:19,941
Let's show the world that it's true.

253
00:19:29,974 --> 00:19:34,186
Let's not do it here now.
It's Dong Bi's house.

254
00:19:39,451 --> 00:19:41,039
Are you mad?

255
00:19:42,836 --> 00:19:45,483
You are.

256
00:19:46,605 --> 00:19:48,506
You're mad.

257
00:20:04,804 --> 00:20:06,624
What are you doing?
A cleaning woman will do it.

258
00:20:06,624 --> 00:20:09,625
- It's so dirty here. I'll just do it.
- That's so sweet of you.

259
00:20:09,625 --> 00:20:11,397
I should raise your salary.

260
00:20:11,397 --> 00:20:15,150
- Why did you come back?
- I forgot to take my car key.

261
00:20:19,838 --> 00:20:22,400
- Hae Jin.
- Yes?

262
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:24,393
What did you say your dream is?

263
00:20:25,190 --> 00:20:27,283
A hospital coordinator.

264
00:20:27,283 --> 00:20:32,165
Doing nice things even if others don't
notice is a very good personality trait.

265
00:20:32,165 --> 00:20:34,823
If you live like this, your dream will come true.

266
00:20:53,797 --> 00:20:55,411
You dressed like a rich woman.

267
00:20:55,411 --> 00:20:56,732
I almost didn't recognize you.

268
00:20:56,732 --> 00:20:59,095
You look the same.

269
00:20:59,095 --> 00:21:03,034
- Because my life hasn't changed.
- I'm getting a divorce by a lawsuit.

270
00:21:04,030 --> 00:21:06,418
What's the reason for telling me that?

271
00:21:06,418 --> 00:21:11,682
You told me that I'm suffering now
because it is the cost of...

272
00:21:11,682 --> 00:21:15,809
And I also told you that you will have
a future full of suffering for sure.

273
00:21:16,877 --> 00:21:19,345
I'm sorry.

274
00:21:19,345 --> 00:21:23,644
- I don't want you to forgive me...
- Don't worry. I won't until I die.

275
00:21:24,900 --> 00:21:29,171
I was so unstable and nervous
even when I was happy.

276
00:21:30,397 --> 00:21:34,089
'Do I really deserve to enjoy this happiness?'

277
00:21:35,094 --> 00:21:38,820
I feel better as if I wanted this to happen.

278
00:21:39,665 --> 00:21:41,825
Your unhappiness is comforting me.

279
00:21:41,825 --> 00:21:47,594
You're trying to win the lawsuit without
feeling guilty by apologizing to me?

280
00:21:48,802 --> 00:21:51,242
I want to reset my life.

281
00:21:51,242 --> 00:21:54,627
I couldn't apologize to you at that
time because I didn't know what to do.

282
00:21:54,627 --> 00:21:57,481
I want to start over.

283
00:21:57,481 --> 00:22:01,694
I think my suffering started
from hurting your feelings.

284
00:22:01,694 --> 00:22:04,002
I've dated a married man too.

285
00:22:04,896 --> 00:22:08,447
After I got a divorce, I became a
person that I really hated to become.

286
00:22:10,521 --> 00:22:13,523
Life is so random.
You don't know what's going to happen.

287
00:22:13,523 --> 00:22:16,395
It's just like there are colorful designs in life.

288
00:22:18,869 --> 00:22:20,576
I should leave now.

289
00:22:22,362 --> 00:22:24,946
I'm kind of happy to see you guys ended like that.

290
00:22:25,337 --> 00:22:28,168
Hurt each other's feelings as much as you can.

291
00:22:28,168 --> 00:22:31,555
And then you should win
because I hate him more.

292
00:22:40,524 --> 00:22:43,098
I know the counteraction will be coming.

293
00:22:43,098 --> 00:22:44,921
Since the money you have is a lot,

294
00:22:44,921 --> 00:22:47,428
they'll ask for a big settlement.

295
00:22:47,428 --> 00:22:49,926
I heard there are many judges that
are favorable to women these days.

296
00:22:49,926 --> 00:22:52,436
Usually a woman judge is like that.

297
00:22:52,436 --> 00:22:55,304
A divorce lawsuit is more
favorable for women usually.

298
00:22:55,304 --> 00:22:58,538
Because people feel pity on
women when they get a divorce.

299
00:22:58,538 --> 00:23:02,642
If it gets disadvantageous for me,
just bring up a compromise.

300
00:23:02,642 --> 00:23:05,182
Yeah, I should.

301
00:23:05,182 --> 00:23:07,376
There's bad news.

302
00:23:07,376 --> 00:23:13,018
The judge for this case is a man
but he's favorable for women.

303
00:23:14,330 --> 00:23:19,912
But Jung Hae Jin changed her lawyer.
I know him. He's very tenacious.

304
00:23:19,912 --> 00:23:21,648
That's not good.

305
00:23:22,696 --> 00:23:27,115
The good news is that I'm
more tenacious than he is.

306
00:23:34,739 --> 00:23:37,977
They didn't come home yet.

307
00:23:39,574 --> 00:23:43,168
Oh my God! When did she take that with her?

308
00:23:43,297 --> 00:23:45,819
It's very dangerous for her!

309
00:23:58,084 --> 00:24:00,785
The light is on.
Your sister must be home.

310
00:24:00,785 --> 00:24:03,880
I can't go home now.
I'm going to go when she's asleep.

311
00:24:03,880 --> 00:24:07,304
Is your sister that scary?
Just give it a shot!

312
00:24:07,304 --> 00:24:09,740
She might be okay with that.

313
00:24:12,005 --> 00:24:15,871
Okay! Give it a shot!
You're teaching a very good lesson!

314
00:24:17,756 --> 00:24:20,201
- I've seen you before!
- Deul Ja.

315
00:24:21,341 --> 00:24:23,766
You crazy bitch!

316
00:24:23,766 --> 00:24:27,654
You made her ride that!
You tricked her to buy a motorcycle?

317
00:24:27,654 --> 00:24:30,258
It's not that. I wanted to ride one.

318
00:24:30,258 --> 00:24:34,720
Wait, are you...

319
00:24:34,720 --> 00:24:37,997
I can't even speak now. You're the one
with the pan fried tofu, aren't you?

320
00:24:37,997 --> 00:24:42,257
You gave him all the side dishes, didn't you?
Tell me.

321
00:24:42,257 --> 00:24:45,205
- You had the tofu, didn't you?
- Yes, I did.

322
00:24:46,222 --> 00:24:49,048
You come here.
You both are going to die tonight.

323
00:24:49,048 --> 00:24:54,200
Are you crazy, huh?
Why do you date a man like him?

324
00:24:54,200 --> 00:24:56,381
Deul Rae!

325
00:24:59,095 --> 00:25:01,935
Deul Rae!
Deul Rae!

326
00:25:01,935 --> 00:25:05,533
Get back here right now!

327
00:25:57,845 --> 00:25:59,104
Get your face out of my way.

328
00:26:11,832 --> 00:26:13,199
What the?

329
00:26:13,199 --> 00:26:15,148
Wear this after you shower.

330
00:26:15,148 --> 00:26:18,734
- Don't you have a woman size?
- You're not supposed to ask me that.

331
00:26:22,563 --> 00:26:25,972
- You're trying to seduce me, aren't you?
- What?

332
00:26:25,972 --> 00:26:32,248
You're pretending to be so
surprised like an innocent woman?

333
00:26:33,051 --> 00:26:38,493
I can't really blame you now.
I should've prepared to listen to your nonsense.

334
00:26:38,493 --> 00:26:40,467
Nonsense?

335
00:26:43,111 --> 00:26:45,311
- Like this?
- Get that out of my sight.

336
00:26:45,997 --> 00:26:48,549
Should I?

337
00:26:53,194 --> 00:26:56,060
If you do that one more time,
I'm going to kiss you again.

338
00:26:58,957 --> 00:27:01,829
It didn't mean anything.
I was playing with you.

339
00:27:22,287 --> 00:27:24,770
She kissed me.

340
00:27:34,950 --> 00:27:36,263
You came home late.

341
00:27:36,263 --> 00:27:38,385
Hae Yoon got a cold so I was with her.

342
00:27:38,385 --> 00:27:40,760
What a good husband you are.

343
00:27:41,679 --> 00:27:42,955
Didn't Dad get a refund for those yet?

344
00:27:42,955 --> 00:27:45,837
He did. Those are from Chae Young.

345
00:27:46,213 --> 00:27:49,887
I knew this would happen so I was going to do it first.

346
00:27:50,475 --> 00:27:52,937
Why did you leave them there?

347
00:27:52,937 --> 00:27:56,684
Just to show you and make
you realize the reality.

348
00:27:57,042 --> 00:27:59,303
She can't afford those.
Does she have to steal stuff then?

349
00:27:59,303 --> 00:28:02,420
- She doesn't have money.
- Why are you yelling?

350
00:28:02,973 --> 00:28:06,577
Not having enough money makes people
uncomfortable and intimidated.

351
00:28:06,577 --> 00:28:09,604
I've become down at heel while preparing the wedding.

352
00:28:09,604 --> 00:28:13,049
This is why I'm mad.
Why do you have to feel like that?

353
00:28:13,049 --> 00:28:16,561
Hae Yoon must've felt this more
than I do but she's very confident.

354
00:28:16,561 --> 00:28:19,443
Do you know how many times she
has controlled me while dating?

355
00:28:19,443 --> 00:28:21,413
I even pretended to die because of her.

356
00:28:21,413 --> 00:28:22,620
You fool.

357
00:28:22,620 --> 00:28:26,206
Your son doesn't have ambitions.
He's just a salary man.

358
00:28:26,206 --> 00:28:29,504
What I can earn is limited.
I should get used to that.

359
00:28:30,009 --> 00:28:34,055
With Hae Yoon, I won't feel
intimidated even if I'm poor.

360
00:28:34,055 --> 00:28:36,176
We have our values that we want to protect.

361
00:28:36,176 --> 00:28:40,217
I'm not going to tell her about the wedding
gift. I don't want to hurt her feelings.

362
00:28:40,217 --> 00:28:41,848
I hope you can do that.

363
00:28:41,848 --> 00:28:43,406
You dweeb.

364
00:28:43,406 --> 00:28:48,109
Blame Dad.
I think I must have gotten his genes.

365
00:28:48,109 --> 00:28:50,216
You half-wit!

366
00:29:04,212 --> 00:29:05,907
Thank you.

367
00:29:07,737 --> 00:29:10,604
I wanted to let down my hair.
Who told you guys to tie my hair?

368
00:29:12,376 --> 00:29:14,622
It's me.

369
00:29:34,455 --> 00:29:38,514
- Why are you wearing shoes in the room?
- These are new. Mrs. Hae bought it for me.

370
00:29:38,514 --> 00:29:40,430
You're a princess.

371
00:29:40,430 --> 00:29:43,800
Fine feathers make fine birds.
Where are you going anyway?

372
00:29:43,800 --> 00:29:45,907
Jung Hoon's cousin's engagement.

373
00:29:45,907 --> 00:29:48,618
You shouldn't go to other people's
occasions after your wedding date is set.

374
00:29:48,618 --> 00:29:51,769
Dong Bi said that too.
It's just a superstition.

375
00:29:51,769 --> 00:29:54,870
Whether it is or not, you shouldn't go.

376
00:29:54,870 --> 00:29:56,753
I have to go anyway. Don't say anything.

377
00:29:57,817 --> 00:29:59,088
Do you know this bastard?

378
00:29:59,088 --> 00:30:00,381
Who?

379
00:30:00,381 --> 00:30:04,019
I think it's him. The one you
talked about when we were eating.

380
00:30:04,019 --> 00:30:06,722
This bastard is close with that
bastard and got a divorce twice.

381
00:30:06,722 --> 00:30:10,330
I know this bastard but that bastard is Do Hyun?

382
00:30:10,330 --> 00:30:12,438
- Yeah.
- What about Min Ho?

383
00:30:12,438 --> 00:30:14,836
Your aunt didn't come home after
she went out with Min Ho.

384
00:30:14,836 --> 00:30:17,066
- Do you know where he lives?
- Do Hyun would know.

385
00:30:17,066 --> 00:30:19,488
Don't keep calling his name.

386
00:30:20,738 --> 00:30:22,592
What should I do about her?

387
00:30:22,592 --> 00:30:24,718
Let her be. She probably has a plan.

388
00:30:24,718 --> 00:30:28,208
Do you think a person with a plan would
ride a motorcycle? What if she gets hurt?

389
00:30:28,208 --> 00:30:30,033
She's going to have to stay home forever.

390
00:30:30,033 --> 00:30:30,604
Mom.

391
00:30:30,604 --> 00:30:33,031
Then I'm the one who has to take care of her.

392
00:30:33,031 --> 00:30:34,834
Don't say that easily just
because it's not your business.

393
00:30:37,835 --> 00:30:39,833
Are you not going to yell at me?

394
00:30:39,833 --> 00:30:41,783
No, I'm not. I'll help you.

395
00:30:43,170 --> 00:30:47,012
Since you're helping him, help him eat
this too. He doesn't eat spinach.

396
00:30:47,012 --> 00:30:50,075
This and this too.

397
00:30:52,048 --> 00:30:54,153
You shouldn't eat only what you want.
Eat this too.

398
00:30:54,153 --> 00:30:56,983
- I don't want to eat.
- Eat it!

399
00:30:56,983 --> 00:31:00,007
Then you eat first.
You don't eat that either.

400
00:31:00,007 --> 00:31:03,563
If you eat, I'll eat too.

401
00:31:05,107 --> 00:31:08,339
Then don't eat. You don't have
to do what you don't want to.

402
00:31:09,718 --> 00:31:11,864
I'm not going to eat.

403
00:31:11,864 --> 00:31:15,037
- Then what are you going to do?
- Play a game.

404
00:31:15,037 --> 00:31:18,212
Get here right now and finish your meal!

405
00:31:18,212 --> 00:31:20,809
Even if you want to play a game, you should eat first.

406
00:31:20,809 --> 00:31:23,857
Do you know you keep two tongues in one mouth?

407
00:31:23,857 --> 00:31:28,473
Go play a game in your room. I'll get
you something to eat soon, okay?

408
00:31:30,774 --> 00:31:33,724
- What are you doing?
- You think it's easy to take care of a kid?

409
00:31:33,724 --> 00:31:38,974
You can't raise a kid. Forget about custody.
I know you're doing it to make me mad.

410
00:31:39,667 --> 00:31:41,836
Do you know the goal of my life recently?

411
00:31:41,836 --> 00:31:45,373
Not giving you anything that you want.

412
00:31:52,757 --> 00:31:55,572
- What are you doing here?
- He's here now?

413
00:31:56,980 --> 00:32:00,464
- You're here.
- Yeah. Hi, how are you?

414
00:32:00,464 --> 00:32:02,421
I heard you got so many complaints about me.

415
00:32:02,421 --> 00:32:03,753
Let's not talk about it.

416
00:32:03,753 --> 00:32:05,892
I came to ask you something.

417
00:32:05,892 --> 00:32:08,510
- You know Min Ho, don't you?
- Why?

418
00:32:08,510 --> 00:32:10,513
Where does he live?

419
00:32:10,513 --> 00:32:13,855
- Why do you want to know?
- You don't have to know that.

420
00:32:13,855 --> 00:32:15,172
Just tell me where he lives.

421
00:32:15,172 --> 00:32:17,169
I know it's not going to be good.
I can't tell you.

422
00:32:17,169 --> 00:32:22,122
Fine. I'll tell you why.
That bastard kidnapped my sister!

423
00:32:22,122 --> 00:32:23,246
Really?

424
00:32:23,246 --> 00:32:25,441
Do you know how old she is?
She can't be kidnapped.

425
00:32:25,441 --> 00:32:27,838
You're going to go there and tell him to take the

426
00:32:27,839 --> 00:32:30,140
responsibility for her just like you did to me.

427
00:32:30,140 --> 00:32:33,220
What?
You're such a crazy bastard.

428
00:32:33,220 --> 00:32:36,873
If I had known what kind of person you
are, I wouldn't have made her marry you.

429
00:32:36,873 --> 00:32:38,470
We would've just gotten some compensation.

430
00:32:38,470 --> 00:32:42,344
I thought you were a great man
since your father was a doctor!

431
00:32:42,344 --> 00:32:44,298
If I think of that time,
I want to poke my eyes!

432
00:32:44,298 --> 00:32:45,498
Me too!

433
00:32:45,498 --> 00:32:47,887
If I had known how rude you are,

434
00:32:47,887 --> 00:32:50,823
I probably wouldn't have
married her either.

435
00:32:50,823 --> 00:32:52,655
I cut my own throat!

436
00:33:03,295 --> 00:33:05,262
You don't know where he lives?

437
00:33:05,262 --> 00:33:07,390
Of course I don't.

438
00:33:08,934 --> 00:33:11,466
Look at him. He doesn't even say good bye.

439
00:33:20,563 --> 00:33:22,959
- Have a seat.
- I should go.

440
00:33:22,959 --> 00:33:25,300
- Do you have a place to go?
- The kindergarten.

441
00:33:25,300 --> 00:33:27,853
Just eat some. I made it for you.

442
00:33:27,853 --> 00:33:30,846
I don't think it'd taste good.
I'm going to go.

443
00:33:33,686 --> 00:33:35,591
Are you shy?
Is that why?

444
00:33:35,591 --> 00:33:37,414
Shy for what?

445
00:33:37,414 --> 00:33:41,242
- You can play me again. Please do that.
- Get that out of my sight.

446
00:33:41,242 --> 00:33:44,854
You don't want to do that now?
Then tell me whenever you want to.

447
00:33:46,193 --> 00:33:49,255
When I'm with you, I think I'm
becoming another person.

448
00:33:49,255 --> 00:33:51,980
- In a good way?
- A bad way.

449
00:33:51,980 --> 00:33:54,780
But I feel so good.

450
00:33:56,102 --> 00:33:57,866
Who is it?

451
00:34:00,853 --> 00:34:03,682
- It's Do Hyun.
- Oh my God!

452
00:34:05,543 --> 00:34:07,367
- What's up?
- Want to ride a motorcycle?

453
00:34:07,367 --> 00:34:09,225
I was going to eat...

454
00:34:09,225 --> 00:34:11,445
What relationship are you
having with Deul Rae?

455
00:34:11,445 --> 00:34:14,455
Why aren't you answering? What is it?

456
00:34:14,455 --> 00:34:17,131
It's not like that.

457
00:34:17,528 --> 00:34:21,177
The apron and the shoes
were Deul Rae's. Right?

458
00:34:21,177 --> 00:34:23,899
Why do you have so many questions today?

459
00:34:23,899 --> 00:34:27,650
Come out! I know you're here.

460
00:34:27,650 --> 00:34:30,305
Come out!

461
00:34:30,305 --> 00:34:34,203
I'm going to tell Deul Ja where you are.
3, 2, 1.

462
00:34:34,203 --> 00:34:37,475
I'm here. Don't tell her.

463
00:34:37,475 --> 00:34:42,658
Deul Rae, don't develop feelings for him.
He would never see you as a woman.

464
00:34:42,658 --> 00:34:46,786
Don't think it's love because
he's being very nice to you.

465
00:34:46,786 --> 00:34:48,795
He's nice to every woman.

466
00:34:48,795 --> 00:34:51,424
He's just playing the fool with you.

467
00:34:52,058 --> 00:34:54,664
I know. I was going to leave.

468
00:34:54,664 --> 00:34:57,904
- Wait. Let me take you home.
- Stop playing with her.

469
00:34:57,904 --> 00:35:00,002
Her feelings might get hurt.

470
00:35:00,002 --> 00:35:03,809
Can you say that to her?
Did you hear that?

471
00:35:03,809 --> 00:35:06,159
My feelings might get hurt.

472
00:35:06,159 --> 00:35:09,707
So don't play the fool with me. I'd never
play the fool with you ever since I met you.

473
00:35:10,461 --> 00:35:12,638
I'm afraid to show my feelings to others.

474
00:35:12,638 --> 00:35:14,846
I'm afraid they'd leave me.

475
00:35:16,240 --> 00:35:21,768
I'm not a great man but if I can live one
more time, I want to do that with you.

476
00:35:22,438 --> 00:35:29,601
I'm not a great woman either so I don't
want to date someone that's not great.

477
00:35:31,467 --> 00:35:34,631
Did you just get rejected by her?

478
00:35:35,310 --> 00:35:38,221
Just leave the house.
You're a really bad man.

479
00:35:38,221 --> 00:35:41,127
The worst thing for a man is to get
embarrassed in front of a woman.

480
00:35:41,127 --> 00:35:43,883
- Why do you like her?
- She's a femme fatale.

481
00:35:46,807 --> 00:35:49,320
He really likes her.

482
00:36:33,951 --> 00:36:35,811
Mrs. Hae.

483
00:36:35,811 --> 00:36:38,317
- Hi.
- You guys came early.

484
00:36:38,439 --> 00:36:42,490
- You look beautiful.
- It's what she bought for me.

485
00:36:42,490 --> 00:36:46,040
- Thank you.
- Sure. Let's go.

486
00:36:46,040 --> 00:36:47,843
Let's go.

487
00:36:47,843 --> 00:36:52,377
Now the groom and the bride
will exchange their rings.

488
00:37:14,721 --> 00:37:20,677
Now the groom, Gong Ki Joong and the
bride, Han Chae Young will cut the cake.

489
00:37:31,094 --> 00:37:36,682
Thank you very much. Let's toast
to a happy marriage.

490
00:37:36,682 --> 00:37:38,631
Please lift the glass in front of you.

491
00:37:40,205 --> 00:37:44,433
For the bride and groom, cheers!

492
00:38:17,466 --> 00:38:19,514
The coffee isn't as good as the one Ki Joong makes.

493
00:38:19,514 --> 00:38:21,626
He's probably engaged by now.

494
00:38:21,626 --> 00:38:25,206
He's a betrayer. He said he would live with me.

495
00:38:26,519 --> 00:38:29,490
- One of us is leaving now.
- The other one is coming.

496
00:38:30,681 --> 00:38:33,879
Are you getting a divorce?

497
00:38:33,879 --> 00:38:36,188
Hae Jin wants a divorce.

498
00:38:36,188 --> 00:38:40,146
Apologize to her and tell her you
will transfer some properties to her.

499
00:38:40,146 --> 00:38:43,501
- Then she will forgive you.
- Why didn't you do that?

500
00:38:43,501 --> 00:38:47,286
Then they would live with me just
because of money. I'd hate that.

501
00:38:47,286 --> 00:38:49,015
Then why do you want me
to do something you hate?

502
00:38:49,015 --> 00:38:53,136
You got a kid. If you have a kid, you can't
only think about if you loved her or not.

503
00:38:53,494 --> 00:38:57,325
I thought she would come back if I gave her some money.

504
00:38:57,325 --> 00:38:59,408
But she sued me now.

505
00:38:59,408 --> 00:39:03,022
- Please don't do that.
- Who doesn't know it's not good?

506
00:39:03,022 --> 00:39:04,329
But I can't just sit there and do nothing.

507
00:39:04,329 --> 00:39:07,045
Just let her do what she wants.

508
00:39:07,490 --> 00:39:10,541
My marriage with my ex-wife was boring but
peaceful. I ruined it to marry Hae Jin.

509
00:39:11,040 --> 00:39:14,811
Do you know how it feels to be betrayed?
How dare she does that to me?

510
00:39:14,811 --> 00:39:20,118
- She's going to get paid for that.
- You're the one who's done wrong!

511
00:39:20,998 --> 00:39:22,666
Give me that.

512
00:39:23,134 --> 00:39:25,210
Wait for me.

513
00:39:29,842 --> 00:39:32,466
Aunt Eun Kyung!

514
00:39:32,923 --> 00:39:36,096
Doing an engagement ceremony
is so classy and nice.

515
00:39:36,096 --> 00:39:38,474
Honey, we had our engagement
here too, didn't we?

516
00:39:38,474 --> 00:39:40,684
Yeah, we did!

517
00:39:40,684 --> 00:39:43,146
You look so beautiful. I like your dress.

518
00:39:43,146 --> 00:39:47,918
- Thank you.
- Live a happy life.

519
00:39:47,918 --> 00:39:50,158
You're going to hear it again at the wedding.

520
00:39:50,158 --> 00:39:54,051
I think you're jealous. Why don't you
have them get engaged?

521
00:39:57,160 --> 00:40:00,382
- Long time no see.
- Yeah.

522
00:40:00,382 --> 00:40:04,053
Dong Bi really didn't come here.
She's irresponsible.

523
00:40:04,053 --> 00:40:06,689
It's a good day.
Let's talk about good things.

524
00:40:06,689 --> 00:40:14,496
Like what? For example, your apology to me was
just a show for your parents-in-law?

525
00:40:17,114 --> 00:40:20,496
Let's go over there and meet people now.

526
00:40:25,861 --> 00:40:27,890
Was that a show?

527
00:40:28,692 --> 00:40:33,650
Why aren't you answering? If that's not
true, I'm going to go yell at her.

528
00:40:33,650 --> 00:40:38,081
- How dare she said that in front of us?
- They're still young. We should understand.

529
00:40:38,081 --> 00:40:41,533
No. Tell me. Is that true?

530
00:40:42,141 --> 00:40:44,492
Yeah.

531
00:40:45,694 --> 00:40:48,508
Don't laugh!

532
00:40:55,387 --> 00:40:57,215
Why did you do that?

533
00:40:57,215 --> 00:40:59,860
There isn't anything that I've done
wrong so I didn't want to apologize.

534
00:40:59,860 --> 00:41:02,706
I'm mad that she made the problems bigger.

535
00:41:02,706 --> 00:41:05,285
So you're just a normal woman.

536
00:41:05,285 --> 00:41:11,185
I really liked how you
endured the unfairness for me.

537
00:41:11,185 --> 00:41:13,011
To you, it was a petty trick?

538
00:41:13,011 --> 00:41:14,749
I'm sorry.

539
00:41:14,749 --> 00:41:17,181
What do you think of this bag?

540
00:41:19,163 --> 00:41:23,832
For others, it's what I gave you as a wedding
gift but it's actually what Mr. Hae gave you.

541
00:41:23,832 --> 00:41:26,310
No. It's what Chae Young
gave me as her wedding gift.

542
00:41:26,310 --> 00:41:28,481
She sent this with a beautiful shawl.

543
00:41:28,481 --> 00:41:31,449
We got a refund for the
one my husband bought.

544
00:41:31,449 --> 00:41:34,567
Jung Hoon wanted this to be a secret
because it might hurt your feelings.

545
00:41:34,567 --> 00:41:37,868
How did you make my son become like that?

546
00:41:38,593 --> 00:41:40,139
I'm sorry.

547
00:41:40,139 --> 00:41:42,119
I declared myself to be a mother-in-law who doesn't

548
00:41:42,120 --> 00:41:43,757
get a wedding gift from
a daughter-in-law.

549
00:41:43,757 --> 00:41:47,479
So now you don't have to prepare for the
wedding gift. Your petty tricks worked.

550
00:41:47,479 --> 00:41:49,653
Didn't it?

551
00:41:50,208 --> 00:41:53,195
How bad is your financial problem?

552
00:41:53,195 --> 00:41:54,911
Your mother owns a store.

553
00:41:55,190 --> 00:41:58,292
She said she's going to
do anything for her kids.

554
00:41:58,292 --> 00:42:01,812
What is she going to do about her daughter's wedding?

555
00:42:02,291 --> 00:42:06,856
Does she think a marriage is like a
business since she's doing the business?

556
00:42:06,856 --> 00:42:10,107
Does she want to make a profit out of your marriage?

557
00:42:10,510 --> 00:42:13,807
It's not the money that causes problems.
It's your mind!

558
00:42:14,816 --> 00:42:18,094
Does she know about the wedding gift?

559
00:42:20,408 --> 00:42:22,373
She doesn't know, does she?

560
00:42:22,373 --> 00:42:25,613
Is my son getting married to an orphan?

561
00:42:26,331 --> 00:42:30,120
Don't cry. If others see this,
they might think I'm the bad one.

562
00:42:30,735 --> 00:42:33,550
People are walking by.

563
00:42:41,151 --> 00:42:44,475
- How was the meal?
- The bread was good.

564
00:42:44,475 --> 00:42:47,137
That's so your style.
Did you buy her those?

565
00:42:47,821 --> 00:42:50,306
You're too kind.

566
00:42:50,306 --> 00:42:52,923
- Let's get in.
- Okay.

567
00:42:54,801 --> 00:42:58,664
Oh my God.

568
00:43:27,803 --> 00:43:30,284
Sang Jin.

569
00:43:32,330 --> 00:43:34,922
- What?
- What's wrong with your voice?

570
00:43:34,922 --> 00:43:36,394
Because I'm in a bathroom.

571
00:43:36,394 --> 00:43:40,934
I have something to tell you about Dong Bi.
It's up to you to come or not..

572
00:43:40,934 --> 00:43:43,451
Let's meet.

573
00:43:56,509 --> 00:43:59,071
I'll go get my car. Wait here.

574
00:44:27,545 --> 00:44:29,981
You came home already?

575
00:44:29,981 --> 00:44:32,068
She left.

576
00:44:32,068 --> 00:44:38,092
- Mom, did you scold her a lot?
- Yeah. I even made her cry.

577
00:44:39,314 --> 00:44:42,621
Why? Do you want to take her side?

578
00:44:42,968 --> 00:44:47,500
- No. Good job.
- I know you don't mean that.

579
00:44:47,500 --> 00:44:49,284
She has twisted thoughts.

580
00:44:49,284 --> 00:44:51,706
I liked her because I
thought she was well-bred

581
00:44:51,707 --> 00:44:54,030
going through hard times.
But I was wrong.

582
00:44:54,030 --> 00:44:56,753
No, she doesn't have twisted thoughts.
Dong Bi is her best friend.

583
00:44:56,753 --> 00:44:59,581
Chae Young started it by saying
how Dong Bi is irresponsible.

584
00:44:59,581 --> 00:45:04,137
She's right though. Dong Bi was
supposed to work but she didn't come.

585
00:45:04,137 --> 00:45:06,973
Did you forget that she dated Ki Joong before?
How could she come to the engagement?

586
00:45:06,973 --> 00:45:09,332
Then why did she say she
would work for Chae Young?

587
00:45:09,332 --> 00:45:13,300
Birds of a feather flock together.

588
00:45:13,300 --> 00:45:15,428
Let's stop.

589
00:45:15,428 --> 00:45:18,498
Who do you think loves you the most?

590
00:45:19,981 --> 00:45:23,719
It's me. I can tell everyone that it's me.

591
00:45:24,904 --> 00:45:28,256
Suck it up! Don't get
controlled by others, you fool!

592
00:45:34,074 --> 00:45:37,279
I'm just going to get a taxi.
I'll call you later.

593
00:45:47,861 --> 00:45:49,698
Isn't this Dong Bi?

594
00:45:52,002 --> 00:45:53,624
I think it is.

595
00:45:53,624 --> 00:45:55,103
It doesn't make sense.

596
00:45:55,103 --> 00:45:58,906
Why did she live like a poor woman then?
She took so much money out of me.

597
00:45:58,906 --> 00:46:01,104
- Do you know anything about this?
- No.

598
00:46:01,104 --> 00:46:04,792
Maybe I wasn't a friend to her.

599
00:46:09,597 --> 00:46:11,982
Jung Hoon.

600
00:46:13,368 --> 00:46:15,693
- Did you guys fight?
- No.

601
00:46:15,693 --> 00:46:17,203
Then why aren't you answering it?

602
00:46:17,203 --> 00:46:19,287
Because I don't want to.

603
00:46:32,482 --> 00:46:34,229
Home.

604
00:46:49,627 --> 00:46:51,774
Home.

605
00:47:01,327 --> 00:47:05,259
I wish when I open my eyes,
my wedding is done.

606
00:47:06,343 --> 00:47:10,292
Then you'd feel relieved that all the
problems you're having are gone?

607
00:47:10,292 --> 00:47:14,341
The problems you're having is just the beginning.

608
00:47:14,341 --> 00:47:18,152
It's like a prep-test. You know you should do
well on a prep-test to do well on a real test.

609
00:47:18,152 --> 00:47:21,491
Don't you regret that you called off
your marriage right before the wedding?

610
00:47:22,548 --> 00:47:25,277
We had a fight every
single day while preparing

611
00:47:25,278 --> 00:47:27,950
for the wedding. We hurt
each other's feelings.

612
00:47:27,950 --> 00:47:31,280
Besides, her father is also my boss.

613
00:47:31,280 --> 00:47:37,281
He was very stubborn. I probably
could endure today but not tomorrow.

614
00:47:37,281 --> 00:47:40,971
I can't take a road when I
know what's going to happen.

615
00:47:40,971 --> 00:47:42,708
If I take the road?

616
00:47:42,708 --> 00:47:46,306
You will be like your sister or give
up everything and drink everyday.

617
00:47:46,306 --> 00:47:49,789
You're so mean. How could you
talk about my sister like that so easily?

618
00:47:49,789 --> 00:47:52,802
Why not? You can't do that easily
because you're embarrassed.

619
00:47:52,802 --> 00:47:55,756
I can't organize my thoughts yet.
I don't know what to do.

620
00:47:56,424 --> 00:47:58,220
Should I go to Do Hyun and use violence?

621
00:47:58,220 --> 00:48:00,560
Don't do that. I think your
mother did that already.

622
00:48:00,560 --> 00:48:02,162
Yeah, you're right.

623
00:48:02,162 --> 00:48:07,361
She must be a hard one. One of the
reasons for the divorce was her.

624
00:48:07,896 --> 00:48:12,270
You probably know everything about my family.
I can't even hide things in front of you.

625
00:48:12,270 --> 00:48:15,883
Do you know how many things
I'm hiding to my fiance?

626
00:48:15,883 --> 00:48:18,200
I feel so bad.

627
00:48:18,200 --> 00:48:21,629
I don't think you should reveal
everything to your fiance.

628
00:48:21,629 --> 00:48:24,300
Thinking like that is just a fantasy.

629
00:48:24,300 --> 00:48:26,421
People can even hide things to themselves.

630
00:48:26,421 --> 00:48:31,935
You should hide things if you can cover
so he doesn't have to be bothered.

631
00:48:31,935 --> 00:48:36,788
- You look so mature.
- So don't be rude to me.

632
00:48:38,061 --> 00:48:40,022
You can rely on me if
you're having hard times.

633
00:48:40,022 --> 00:48:44,342
I'm doing this because of the nice things
you've done for me when we dated.

634
00:49:23,876 --> 00:49:26,555
You're bothering me.

635
00:49:26,555 --> 00:49:28,006
What did I do?

636
00:49:28,006 --> 00:49:31,756
You embarrassed me in front
of people a while ago.

637
00:49:31,756 --> 00:49:33,507
You hold grudges so much.

638
00:49:33,507 --> 00:49:35,866
You made people embarrassed first.

639
00:49:35,866 --> 00:49:39,557
I hate when the mood gets embarrassed
just because of one person.

640
00:49:39,557 --> 00:49:46,003
Why should I have a marriage without
love if I can't do anything that I want?

641
00:49:54,945 --> 00:49:57,258
I spanked him for the first time.

642
00:49:57,258 --> 00:50:00,235
He was so precious to me that
I didn't even hit him at all.

643
00:50:00,235 --> 00:50:02,720
It was like my heart breaking.

644
00:50:02,720 --> 00:50:06,365
You find out violence isn't a
good thing after you used it?

645
00:50:06,365 --> 00:50:14,006
But he doesn't care if I'm mad or heart
broken because he's crazy about Hae Yoon.

646
00:50:14,006 --> 00:50:17,439
I should do something about that.

647
00:50:17,439 --> 00:50:19,414
Then what are you going to do?

648
00:50:19,414 --> 00:50:22,745
I think I should fish for
what I want from now on.

649
00:50:22,745 --> 00:50:26,422
I hate to say this but
one's heart follows money.

650
00:50:26,422 --> 00:50:30,241
Hae Yoon's mother doesn't want
to spend a penny on my son.

651
00:50:30,241 --> 00:50:33,515
I guess how she treated him at the
meeting is how she treats him now.

652
00:50:35,227 --> 00:50:36,998
How did she treat him at the meeting?

653
00:50:36,998 --> 00:50:42,200
She was late at the meeting and she said
he's just a regular salary man.

654
00:50:42,200 --> 00:50:44,953
Hae Yoon had many chances to meet better
men but since Hae Yoon likes him,

655
00:50:44,953 --> 00:50:47,023
she approved this marriage.

656
00:50:48,206 --> 00:50:52,392
- Do you remember all this?
- How can I not? It's about my son.

657
00:50:52,392 --> 00:50:56,500
I can't let this happen again.

658
00:51:07,320 --> 00:51:08,440
I'll get a taxi when I'm done.
You can go home first.

659
00:51:09,795 --> 00:51:13,244
I'll drink some tea while I wait.
Call me when you're done.

660
00:51:24,259 --> 00:51:26,682
- Hi.
- Hi.

661
00:51:26,682 --> 00:51:28,572
- Come here.
- Okay.

662
00:51:30,776 --> 00:51:33,125
- Have a seat.
- Thanks.

663
00:51:34,054 --> 00:51:38,603
I was kind of neglecting my store
so I had to ask you to come here.

664
00:51:38,603 --> 00:51:40,768
It's okay.

665
00:51:40,768 --> 00:51:42,961
Would you like to drink some coffee?

666
00:51:42,961 --> 00:51:46,980
It's okay. I drank it before I came.
Don't worry.

667
00:51:46,980 --> 00:51:49,061
How much is the rent for this place?

668
00:51:49,061 --> 00:51:50,829
Why do you ask? Are you going to pay for it?

669
00:51:50,829 --> 00:51:52,072
It's not that much.

670
00:51:52,072 --> 00:51:54,384
So how much is it?

671
00:51:54,384 --> 00:51:57,157
Why did you want to see me?

672
00:51:57,157 --> 00:51:59,951
You want me to help you with Hae
Yoon and Joon Hoon's house right?

673
00:51:59,951 --> 00:52:01,713
- Yeah, I do.
- I'll help you.

674
00:52:01,713 --> 00:52:03,307
How much money are you willing to spend on that?

675
00:52:04,551 --> 00:52:07,789
I need to see the house to figure that out.

676
00:52:07,789 --> 00:52:12,644
Oh, you didn't see the house yet.
I'll show you that soon.

677
00:52:12,644 --> 00:52:16,670
Then how much are you willing to
pay for your daughter's wedding?

678
00:52:16,670 --> 00:52:18,834
Why do you keep asking about money?

679
00:52:18,834 --> 00:52:25,988
Getting our kids married is
something we should do together.

680
00:52:25,988 --> 00:52:28,801
It has been one sided until now.

681
00:52:29,620 --> 00:52:32,377
You can't do the same amount as I do.
You're the groom's side.

682
00:52:32,377 --> 00:52:36,577
I know parents of the groom
should pay more.

683
00:52:36,577 --> 00:52:40,164
I guess there's nothing I can do. If
you want us to pay, we'll have to.

684
00:52:40,164 --> 00:52:44,808
If you want us to buy the house and pay
for the wedding hall, then we should.

685
00:52:44,808 --> 00:52:46,451
What is she trying to do?

686
00:52:46,451 --> 00:52:48,864
Of course there aren't many people who don't
do that but since you have a money problem,

687
00:52:48,864 --> 00:52:51,274
we should do that.

688
00:52:51,274 --> 00:52:53,562
Yeah, you're right.

689
00:52:53,562 --> 00:52:58,479
But if you try, you can fit
our plan to suit others.

690
00:52:58,479 --> 00:53:03,573
You can raise your standard. I
think you're sparing bones too much.

691
00:53:03,573 --> 00:53:07,998
This bag is what I got from my nephew's wife.

692
00:53:08,745 --> 00:53:11,393
Would you like to get a brand
named bag as a wedding gift?

693
00:53:11,393 --> 00:53:19,801
Would you like to get a brand
named bag as a wedding gift?

694
00:53:20,444 --> 00:53:23,893
I told Hae Yoon not to do the wedding gift.

695
00:53:23,893 --> 00:53:26,754
Then all we have left is buying
furniture for the house.

696
00:53:26,754 --> 00:53:29,527
You said you wanted me to help
you with that stuff last time.

697
00:53:29,527 --> 00:53:33,999
Since the kids are busy working. How
about you take a look at the house and

698
00:53:33,999 --> 00:53:39,114
give me the estimated amount of money?
I'll decorate their house with that.

699
00:53:39,114 --> 00:53:41,523
You care about your kids very much.

700
00:53:41,523 --> 00:53:45,149
So you probably want to buy nice
stuff for their first house.

701
00:53:45,149 --> 00:53:49,993
It's the mother who loves the son-in-law.

702
00:53:49,993 --> 00:53:52,528
Care about him too not just
your first son-in-law.

703
00:53:53,435 --> 00:53:56,792
- Sure.
- Then I'll see you later.

704
00:53:57,678 --> 00:54:00,226
How are you going home? It'll cost
you a lot if you take a taxi here.

705
00:54:06,712 --> 00:54:08,768
Bye.

706
00:54:13,388 --> 00:54:18,388
Some women have it all, and some women
don't have anything.

707
00:54:20,086 --> 00:54:22,870
I won't feel small because of that.

708
00:54:24,029 --> 00:54:26,830
The plaintiff, Nam Do Hyun, wants a divorce?

709
00:54:26,830 --> 00:54:28,413
Yes.

710
00:54:28,413 --> 00:54:30,735
Are you not going to change your mind?

711
00:54:30,735 --> 00:54:32,976
You've lived with her as
husband and wife for years.

712
00:54:32,976 --> 00:54:34,910
I'm not going to.

713
00:54:34,910 --> 00:54:40,186
The defendant, Jung Hae Jin,
do you want a divorce?

714
00:54:40,186 --> 00:54:41,074
Yes.

715
00:54:41,074 --> 00:54:45,841
- Do you not want to change your mind?
- No.

716
00:54:45,841 --> 00:54:48,579
There's a different view on division
of property and compensation.

717
00:54:48,579 --> 00:54:52,723
- Does the defendant plan to submit evidence?
- Yes.

718
00:54:52,723 --> 00:54:55,281
In order to prove the affair,

719
00:54:55,281 --> 00:54:56,096
I'd like to request his call history.

720
00:54:56,096 --> 00:55:02,397
And to find out his properties, I'd like to
request financial transactions and income tax.

721
00:55:02,397 --> 00:55:05,162
Is the plaintiff planning to submit the evidence?

722
00:55:05,162 --> 00:55:10,319
To prove her overspending, I'd request
detailed statement of her card.

723
00:55:11,136 --> 00:55:15,610
Then I'll set up the date again
after you submit the evidence.

724
00:55:16,429 --> 00:55:18,206
Rise.

725
00:55:25,341 --> 00:55:27,449
Nice to see you again.

726
00:55:27,845 --> 00:55:29,692
We might be friends if we see
each other one more time.

727
00:55:29,692 --> 00:55:32,810
- Be easy on us.
- That's what I wanted to tell you.

728
00:55:32,810 --> 00:55:34,917
So he's the new lawyer?

729
00:55:36,807 --> 00:55:41,028
Hi, I'm Jun Sang Jin.
Contact me when you need me.

730
00:55:41,028 --> 00:55:44,072
- I'm specialized in divorce cases.
- You're kind of brazen.

731
00:55:44,072 --> 00:55:46,335
Not as much as you are.

732
00:55:46,719 --> 00:55:47,576
I'll see you at home.

733
00:55:47,576 --> 00:55:50,072
I'm not going to make food for you anymore.
Eat it at Yuri's house.

734
00:55:50,072 --> 00:55:52,369
So you can take a picture
of me as the evidence?

735
00:55:52,369 --> 00:55:55,433
Feel free to go. I already have
enough pictures for the evidence.

736
00:55:55,433 --> 00:55:57,485
Yeah, feel free to go.

737
00:55:57,485 --> 00:56:02,192
We're debating which pictures we should
use as evidence. There are so many.

738
00:56:02,192 --> 00:56:05,248
It can't be one sided.

739
00:56:05,248 --> 00:56:07,377
There's a lot of evidence to
prove your overspending.

740
00:56:07,377 --> 00:56:11,754
Women who overspend usually
ruin their family.

741
00:56:12,252 --> 00:56:14,472
It's not referring to you, Hae Jin.

742
00:56:14,472 --> 00:56:18,417
If it's not referring to her, then what
you said before becomes useless.

743
00:56:18,417 --> 00:56:21,864
You make money by saying useless stuff. I'm so jealous.

744
00:56:21,864 --> 00:56:25,105
She's going to have to pay for a contingent fee anyway.

745
00:56:25,105 --> 00:56:26,269
It must be tough.

746
00:56:26,269 --> 00:56:31,139
No, it's not. I'll pay her with the money that I will get from your property.

747
00:56:31,139 --> 00:56:33,207
- It's all your money.
- Let's stop it here.

748
00:56:33,207 --> 00:56:37,725
He's still your husband in a document.
Let's go easy on him for now. Let's go.

749
00:56:50,484 --> 00:56:52,711
I met your mother.

750
00:56:52,711 --> 00:56:55,629
Do you also think this marriage is your loss?

751
00:57:08,234 --> 00:57:11,998
- Drink some tea.
- You can just tell me.

752
00:57:13,312 --> 00:57:16,578
I think a man and a woman are different.

753
00:57:16,578 --> 00:57:18,511
It's different from how they look.

754
00:57:18,511 --> 00:57:21,772
What a man can do and what a woman can do are also different.

755
00:57:22,827 --> 00:57:26,762
A house that a husband and a wife live should be provided by the groom's side.

756
00:57:26,762 --> 00:57:28,772
You can't change that in one day.

757
00:57:28,772 --> 00:57:31,185
She took the credit herself for buying the house.

758
00:57:31,185 --> 00:57:33,572
And now she starts to interfere about furniture for the house.

759
00:57:33,572 --> 00:57:35,030
I can't even breath.

760
00:57:35,030 --> 00:57:38,840
She wants me to give her the budget.
Is this a congress or something?

761
00:57:38,840 --> 00:57:41,198
She said she will do the execution of the budget.

762
00:57:41,198 --> 00:57:45,147
Have you heard of a mother-in-law decorating a marital home?

763
00:57:45,147 --> 00:57:46,856
I'll talk about that with my mom.

764
00:57:46,856 --> 00:57:50,962
Don't just talk with her. You should do something about this!

765
00:57:50,962 --> 00:57:53,087
You're not a man if you can't protect your woman!

766
00:57:53,087 --> 00:57:54,372
- Mrs. Jung.
- What?

767
00:57:54,372 --> 00:57:57,760
- Can I be honest with you today?
- Sure!

768
00:57:57,760 --> 00:58:00,428
I don't think you should talk about this with me.

769
00:58:01,398 --> 00:58:02,877
Then who should I talk with?

770
00:58:02,877 --> 00:58:05,330
I think you should talk about this with nobody.

771
00:58:06,009 --> 00:58:08,356
Are you speaking with a serious face in front of me?

772
00:58:08,356 --> 00:58:10,991
Yes, I am speaking with a serious face.

773
00:58:10,991 --> 00:58:13,628
I can't make a funny face in front of you.

774
00:58:14,273 --> 00:58:19,202
- Are you dissatisfied with me?
- Yes, I am.
